# BuildKit reads this file instead of the repository-root .dockerignore for rust/services/model-streaming/Dockerfile.
# The root file drops every `bin` directory, which would remove privoke-transport/src/bin. Allow-list only what the
# build needs, so the build context stays small.
*
!rust
!shared/proto
!models/privoke-*.json
rust/target
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
